// AWS IAM S3Browser User or AccessKey Creation | T1059.009, T1078.004 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/cloud/aws/cloudtrail/aws_iam_s3browser_user_or_accesskey_creation.yml
any where eventSource:"iam.amazonaws.com" and (eventName like~ ("CreateUser", "CreateAccessKey")) and userAgent:"*S3 Browser*"
